{"id": "34605", "title": "匆匆，太匆匆", "author": "琼瑶", "category": "文学名著", "count": 24, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/34/34605/34605s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34605.htm", "intro": "“我不敢怨恨上帝，不敢怨恨命运，只是不懂，真的不懂－\r\n　　为何如匆匆地带去了我的驼驼－”\r\n　　这是韩青和驼驼真实而凄凉的爱情故事，年轻的生命；许以生生世世相守的爱恋；单纯不曲折的故事，却如此结局，怎不令人扼腕？\r\n　　令人叹息？\r\n　　也许把握现有的，\r\n　　珍惜身边的一切，\r\n　　人生可以不怨恨、不后悔；\r\n　　匆匆，太匆匆！\r\n　　匆匆，太匆匆！……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34605", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2199124.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1章", "file": "2199125.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2章", "file": "2199126.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3章", "file": "2199127.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4章", "file": "2199128.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5章", "file": "2199129.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6章", "file": "2199130.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7章", "file": "2199131.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8章", "file": "2199132.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9章", "file": "2199133.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10章", "file": "2199134.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11章", "file": "2199135.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12章", "file": "2199136.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第13章", "file": "2199137.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第14章", "file": "2199138.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第15章", "file": "2199139.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第16章", "file": "2199140.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第17章", "file": "2199141.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第18章", "file": "2199142.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第19章", "file": "2199143.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第20章", "file": "2199144.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第21章", "file": "2199145.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第22章", "file": "2199146.html", "available": true}, {"title": "后记", "file": "2199147.html", "available": true}]}